@MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress = http://localhost:5248

### List all forecasts
GET {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/weather-forecasts
Accept: application/json

### First page (default size 5)
GET {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/weather-forecasts/page?size=5
Accept: application/json

### Next page — paste NextCursor from the previous response
GET {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/weather-forecasts/page?size=5&cursor={{nextCursor}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a forecast
POST {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/weather-forecasts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "temperatureC": 18,
  "summary": "Mild"
}

### Replace — use Id/ETag from a GET; a stale ETag returns 409
PUT {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/weather-forecasts/{{forecastId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-20",
  "temperatureC": 22,
  "summary": "Warm",
  "eTag": 0
}

### Soft-delete without ETag
DELETE {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/weather-forecasts/{{forecastId}}

### Soft-delete with ETag guard
DELETE {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/weather-forecasts/{{forecastId}}?eTag={{eTag}}

### Second delete of the same id returns 404
DELETE {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/weather-forecasts/{{forecastId}}

###
GET {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/notes
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{MongoDb.WebApi.Sample_HostAddress}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "hello",
  "priority": "High"
}
